### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UndergroundParkingGarageNightScene" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :description "Low-visibility environment with parked vehicles and potential occlusion risks" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Parked vehicles in underground garage" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Nighttime with artificial lighting" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Parked vehicles may obscure moving vehicles or pedestrians" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Bright artificial lighting may distract driver attention" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.50"^^xsd:float .
```

